      "id": "I50.energy",
      "kind": "internal-obligation",
      "contract": "49 literal Tf differentiability, actual gradient L2, variance L1 and sharp η energy inequality survive unchanged. Substitute actual defect norm², preserve cη exactly even at αη=1."
    },
